readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	gettinginvolved2	gettinginvolved2			0	hu	A ${PRODUCTNAME}-közösség számára igen hasznos, ha Ön aktívan részt vesz ennek a nyílt forráskódú projektnek a fejlesztésében.				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	gettingimvolved3	gettingimvolved3			0	hu	As a user, you are already a valuable part of the suite's development process and we would like to encourage you to take an even more active role with a view to being a long-term contributor to the community. Please join and check out the user page at <a href="https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html">https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html</a>				20200411 15:09:53
