helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151096				0	hu	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
