helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3155553				0	hu	Type the character that you want to separate the chapter number(s) from the caption number in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Separator\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
